    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91528b9963ab874401666d6c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今年旨在提升实力的夏季集训也开始了。\n但与往年相比、有些不同之处――",
      "source_fingerprint": "0148739c84c3d3aec40bcb1f6d3579a835433a6b672abcdfdc8a5d37348d0b9f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
