      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――哎呀、虽说每年都这样……\n今天的酷暑依旧不留情面啊――",
      "source_fingerprint": "91200f70447d4081dd9c5c1de72f991ba42a3b7e8a20a8fecd06ff9fa79b6739",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
