    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bc8ed75c9a2dc7f1a0d2de1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀、承蒙邀请不胜荣幸啊！\n――黄金巨匠选手！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aee06c913e150c232f004bed98e4b10c679906e55ae2fcdaee8d70e5de092885",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d3b094a9f54cd84d2c5cb56",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此时威严现身的是黄金巨匠……\n她是接连制霸了今年的『皐月赏』『日本德比』、\n距离实现经典三冠只差一步的赛马娘。\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7c4afc7a7a9d89bfb0b454a883e16873e63c72cf08360233b426333cb07eaa0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4aa5886bd9f362a8bf94ab0d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当然、她的热度比起迷人景致毫不逊色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "369d346dd25b8073572c3e8808354d10ed4760cb6b4b5f012bef48c8e0a09eca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c737251e962e7b4fef80a286",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "记者A",
      "source_fingerprint": "e727284e47e7d9a58d24f984ebd7a8d19c16f65187c12dd1c7871d7683e242d3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66e43251b5d444c934699c73",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在世间都在说您\n斩获经典三冠已经板上钉钉、\n请问您对此有多少自信呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3650d1a78884d33c8d9c214cf3a54cd1b47878cb1e3a37eab801a904e48ab4bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7721593e5de44d59d5b87eec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄金巨匠",
      "source_fingerprint": "2890107b21ce870cc8ff5653b89724712215b18ebf279831a6ff7fb65f740fbf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65cf57e1d94722a96066757d",
      "kind": "story",
